    {"id": "urgent-ticket-request-then-skip-cancel-resume",
      "notes": "16 Nov good chat. A ticket request with no problem asks what the problem is (urgent alone is not a subject). The problem then starts the details without a second offer; an unknown page is skipped, the error is taken, the summary shows. A polite cancel stops it and nothing is sent; asking for it again brings the summary back.",
      "input": {"turns": ["افتح لي تذكرة عاجلة", "زر الارشفة لا يعمل", "مااعرف", "ERORROROR!", "لا شكرا الغها ما قصرت", "اي احتاجها"]},
      "expected": {"turns": [
        {"not_ran": ["search", "ticket_operator"], "facts": {"intent": "other", "active_issue": null, "validation": "pass"}, "must_have": [["المشكلة", "مشكلة"]], "pending": null, "created": 0, "language": "ar"},
        {"ran": ["ticket_operator"], "facts": {"operator_action": "request_detail", "validation": "pass"}, "pending": "detail", "created": 0, "language": "ar"},
        {"ran": ["ticket_operator"], "facts": {"operator_action": "request_detail", "validation": "pass"}, "pending": "detail", "created": 0, "language": "ar"},
        {"ran": ["ticket_operator"], "facts": {"operator_action": "show_summary", "validation": "pass"}, "pending": "summary", "created": 0, "language": "ar"},
        {"ran": ["ticket_operator"], "facts": {"operator_action": "cancelled", "active_issue": null, "validation": "pass"}, "pending": null, "created": 0, "queued": 0, "language": "ar"},
        {"ran": ["ticket_operator"], "facts": {"validation": "pass"}, "pending": "summary", "created": 0, "language": "ar"}]}},

    {"id": "print-steps-failed-ticket-with-why-question-and-edit",
